      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Carry your real dragon egg through the shared kingdom to its marked nest.
    ACTION held gently stabilizes the finite cradle restraints and comforts a hatched
    baby; it cannot erase impacts. Drive slowly over rough ground. Cracks lower condition;
    a hatching egg becomes the same physical cargo with an animated baby. If cargo
    comes loose, stop within26m and press ACTION to use the physical recovery hoist.
    At your marked nest loading bay, stop and press ACTION to unload by crane; AI
    uses the same equipment. Only the correct nest with the actual settled egg or
    baby scores. Delivery value combines condition, time and gentle handling; an
    absent cargo never scores. Protective mothers patrol and inspect; actual rough
    handling can provoke a temporary response. A full journey has15minutes. Customized
    trucks, shared inputs, weather, pause, results and rematches retain their original
    owners.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
